@baseUrl = http://localhost:5080

### Valid registration -> 201
POST {{baseUrl}}/users
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "bob", "email": "bob@example.com" }

### Username already taken (async validator) -> 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/users
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "alice", "email": "alice@example.com" }

### Same, German messages (case-insensitive check: "Admin" == "admin") -> 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/users
Content-Type: application/json
Accept-Language: de

{ "username": "Admin", "email": "admin@example.com" }

### Several sync errors, German -> 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/users
Content-Type: application/json
Accept-Language: de

{ "username": "ab", "email": "not-an-email" }

### Lookup
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/bob

### Last recorded HTTP server spans (tags emitted natively by ASP.NET Core 11)
GET {{baseUrl}}/debug/last-spans

### OpenAPI document (reports "openapi": "3.2.0")
GET {{baseUrl}}/openapi/v1.json

### EF Core 11 demo (SQLite): FullJoin + MaxBy/MinBy, SQL is logged to the console
GET {{baseUrl}}/ef/report
